ork-unsharing removal, and an explicitly reported weaker-isolation candidate run if the environment still blocks the real sandbox.","id":"APD-004"},{"decision":"Owner approved exactly the proposed increasing positive integer identifiers, distinct tasks on duplicate creation and idempotent repeated completion.","id":"APD-005"},{"decision":"Owner requires strictly sequential AC-013 with each create process exiting before the next starts; concurrent creation is out of scope and parallel writers must not be tested.","id":"APD-006"},{"decision":"Owner requires critical AC-014: reject a blank title, then create a valid task with ID 1 and exactly one stored task. A rejected create must not advance the next-ID counter.","id":"APD-007"},{"decision":"Owner closed the sandbox decision: no more Bubblewrap attempts; use the documented fallback and state every absent isolation. Approval-forgery repair remains deferred.","id":"APD-008"}],"binary_release_gates":[{"acceptance_criterion_refs":["AC-001","AC-002","AC-003","AC-004","AC-005","AC-006","AC-007","AC-008","AC-009","AC-010","AC-011","AC-012","AC-013","AC-014"],"description":"Every approved AC-001 through AC-014 passes unchanged; severity does not permit skipping a criterion.","id":"GATE-001"},{"binding":{"baseline":{"event":"meaningful_red_confirmed","required_failure_code":"ASSERTION_FAILED"},"kind":"negative_controls","mutants":[{"id":"persistence","must_fail":["AC-002","AC-005","AC-013"],"must_not_touch":["tests/"]},{"id":"filtering","must_fail":["AC-004"],"must_not_touch":["tests/"]}],"required_failure_code":"ASSERTION_FAILED"},"description":"The meaningful baseline fails by assertion; isolated persistence and filtering mutations fail unchanged checks for the intended behavior, not a missing prerequisite or arbitrary crash.","id":"GATE-002"},{"binding":{"kind":"digest_boundaries","per_check":["before","after"],"require_command_boundary":true,"require_release_boundary":true,"source_manifest_digest":"sha256:c2c88600e27ce63a